<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0019/tu_0032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Beta-blockers and/or flecainide with or without acetazolamide should be considered in patients with Andersen–Tawil syndrome to treat VA." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0019/e_0234> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ProcedureOrInterventionEntity> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0019/e_0134/normalization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/EntityNormalization> .
