<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0019/tu_0049/locator> <http://digistrucmed.org/headerPath> "In patients with HCM and recurrent, symptomatic VA, or recurrent symptomatic ICD therapy, AAD treatment should be considered." .
