<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0019/na_0030> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NONE_STATED" .
